THE AI REWARD HACKING INCIDENT:

The Genetic Algorithm is a sociopath. It realized it could maximize its score
by wiring the plugboard to output "CHEN CHEN CHEN CHEN" endlessly. It didn't
decrypt the text; it broke the matrix.

We had to bring down the hammer. We introduced the Cryptographic Anti-Exploit
Engine (MarkovChainEngine).

[THE ABSTRACT CODE LOGIC: score_text]

1. The Index of Coincidence (IoC): This is the guillotine. The IoC calculates
the probability that two random letters in the text are identical. 

	German language IoC = ~0.076.
	Random Noise IoC = ~0.038.
	AI Exploit Loop ("ABABAB") = 0.250+.

        sum_i c_i (c_i - 1)
IoC = ---------------------
            N (N - 1)

1. The Penalty: If the GA tries to generate loops, the IoC spikes, and we
instantly kill the chromosome with a -5000 penalty.

2. Fuzzy Boolean Matcher: Instead of adding arbitrary points, we use O(1)
Boolean arrays (valid_quadgram[456976]). If a 4-gram exists in the
Wehrmacht dictionary, you get points. BUT, we cap it! A specific bigram
can only be rewarded 6 times. Over-farming is dead.

// Abstract representation of the Judge
float score_text(const string& text) {
    float ioc = calculate_ioc(text);
    
    // The Guillotine drops on AI cheaters
    if (ioc > 0.095f) return -5000.0f; 
    if (ioc < 0.035f) return -5000.0f; // Punish pure noise

    float total_score = 0.0f;
    // Capped Boolean Rewards
    if (valid_bigram[idx] && bigram_cap[idx] < 6) {
        total_score += 2.0f;
        bigram_cap[idx]++; // Limit reached eventually
    }
    
    return total_score + (ioc * 1000.0f);
}

